  "note": "Complete storage layout of AequitasV8, in declaration order. test/AequitasV8_storage_layout.ts compares every entry with the compiler's storageLayout and fails on any difference (missing, extra, moved, retyped). Mapping value slot = keccak256(pad32(key) . pad32(slot)): keyEncoding 'address' -> Go mappingSlot(addr.Bytes(), slot); 'uint256'/'bytes32' -> Go mappingSlotBytes32(key, slot). writer: 'go' = only the Go mirror writes it (the contract never does); 'contract' = registerWithSig writes it, Go mirrors/migrates it; 'node' = set at deployment and kept current by the node itself: exactly its own relayer (contract_deploy.go v8RegistrarAbgleichen); no other Go path writes it.",
